<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6b7280 0%, #4b5563 100%);
        color: white;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
      }
      .content {
        background: #f9f9f9;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
      }
      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 12px 30px;
        background: #667eea;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .trade-details {
        background: white;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-left: 4px solid #6b7280;
      }
      .info-box {
        background: #e5e7eb;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 30px;
        color: #666;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='header'>
      <h1>⏰ Trade Expired</h1>
    </div>
    <div class='content'>
      <p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

      {{#if isProposer}}
        <p>Your trade proposal for
          <strong>{{itemName}}</strong>
          has expired without receiving a response from
          <strong>{{otherPartyName}}</strong>.</p>

        <div class='info-box'>
          <p><strong>What happened?</strong></p>
          <p style='margin: 5px 0 0 0;'>Trade proposals automatically expire
            after 72 hours to keep the marketplace fresh and active. The other
            party didn't respond in time, so this trade is now closed.</p>
        </div>

        <p>Don't worry! You can:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Propose the trade again if the item is still available</li>
          <li>Browse other items that might interest you</li>
          <li>Continue exploring SwapBuds for new opportunities</li>
        </ul>
      {{else}}
        <p>A trade proposal from
          <strong>{{otherPartyName}}</strong>
          for
          <strong>{{itemName}}</strong>
          has expired.</p>

        <div class='info-box'>
          <p><strong>What happened?</strong></p>
          <p style='margin: 5px 0 0 0;'>Trade proposals automatically expire
            after 72 hours to keep the marketplace fresh and active. Since you
            didn't respond in time, this trade is now closed.</p>
        </div>

        <p>If you're still interested in this trade, you can reach out to
          {{otherPartyName}}
          directly through their profile.</p>
      {{/if}}

      <center>
        <a href='{{tradeUrl}}' class='button'>View Trade Details</a>
      </center>

      <p>Keep exploring and happy swapping! 🎉</p>
    </div>
    <div class='footer'>
      <p>SwapBuds - Trading made easy</p>
      <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
